OL,3,ADavey says Lib Dems are 'firewall
OL,4,Aagainst Farage' as conference begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Ed Davey said the Liberal Democrats
OL,7,Fare "a firewall against Nigel Farage
OL,8,Fand Reform" as the party's conference
OL,9,Fbegan in Brighton.
OL,11,FThe Lib Dem leader sought to strike a
OL,12,Fmore combative stance as he faced down
OL,13,Fcriticism from his own MPs that the
OL,14,Fparty was struggling for relevance and
OL,15,Fbeing too polite about problems.
OL,17,FOn the first day of the autumn
OL,18,Fconference, Sir Ed warned an "unholy
OL,19,Falliance" between Conservative leader
OL,20,FKemi Badenoch and Farage could turn the
OL,21,FUK into a "Trump satellite state".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
